    "2": {
      "reviewed": true,
      "translation": "The Blessed Lord said: This body is called the field, O son of Kuntī; one who knows this is called the knower of the field by those who know this subject. Śrīdhara explains “field” as the body, the ground from which worldly existence sprouts, and “knower” as the one who regards it as “I” and “mine” and experiences its results.",
