    "3": {
      "reviewed": true,
      "translation": "Know Me also as the knower of the field in all fields, O Bhārata. The knowledge of the field and the knower of the field—that is what I regard as knowledge. Śrīdhara says that other learning, when it does not produce this discrimination, is merely empty scholarship because it remains a cause of bondage.",
